.TH "RPM-PLUGIN-FAPOLICYD" "8" "2026-03-06" "RPM 6.0.1"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
rpm-plugin-fapolicyd \- Fapolicyd plugin for the RPM Package Manager
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The plugin gathers metadata of currently installed files.\& It sends the
information about files and about ongoing rpm transaction to the
fapolicyd daemon.\& The information is written to Linux pipe which is
placed in \fI/var/run/fapolicyd/fapolicyd.\&fifo\fR.\&
.PP
.SH "پیکربندی (CONFIGURATION)"
.PP
There are currently no options for this plugin in particular.\& See
\fBrpm-plugins\fR(8) on how to control plugins in general.\&
.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBfapolicyd\fR(8), \fBrpm-plugins\fR(8)
